<div class="{{ block }}__policy-list">
  <article class="{{ block }}__policy">
    <h2 class="{{ block }}__policy-title">California Prop 65</h2>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text"><strong>WARNING:</strong> This product can expose you to chemicals known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects or other reproductive harm. For more information go to <a href="https://www.P65Warnings.ca.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.P65Warnings.ca.gov</a>.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="{{ block }}__policy">
    <h2 class="{{ block }}__policy-title">Return Policy</h2>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">We inspect every item before shipping including the squeakers, stitching and overall appearance.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">We offer free returns if what we shipped is not what you ordered.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">Returned items must be unused in their original packaging.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">A toy’s longevity varies depending on the pet and its level of use. We cannot be responsible for how a pet plays with its new toy. “My dog tore it to shreds” is not our responsibility and is not a valid return.</p>
  </article>

  <article class="{{ block }}__policy">
    <h2 class="{{ block }}__policy-title">Shipping Policy</h2>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">We always ship next day when possible.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">Expect items to take 3–5 business days to arrive.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">There can be unexpected delays due to weather or carrier mistakes.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">You can track your item and/or contact us for questions.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">If your item is lost, with no movement for 30 days, we will replace or refund it.</p>
    <p class="{{ block }}__policy-text">If your item says it is delivered, it is delivered. From there you must contact your local post office.</p>
  </article>
</div>
